# PART 4 — DATABASE SCHEMA, GEOSPATIAL DESIGN & DATA RELATIONSHIPS

---

# 1. DATABASE OBJECTIVE

The database must serve as the central repository for:

```text
Events
Assets
Devices
Users
Alerts
Locations
Analytics
Geospatial Data
Audit Logs
System Configuration
```

The schema must be generic enough to support:

* SOC
* NOC
* Fleet Tracking
* Smart Cities
* Fraud Monitoring
* Emergency Systems
* IoT Platforms

without redesigning tables.

