# 37. PERFORMANCE STRATEGY

Hot tables:

```text
events

asset_tracks

sensor_readings
```

These grow rapidly.

Implement:

```text
Pagination

Date Filtering

Aggregation Tables

Background Jobs
```

---

# 38. DATA RETENTION

Recommended:

```text
Raw Events
2 Years

Asset Tracks
1 Year

Sensor Readings
6 Months

Audit Logs
3 Years
```

Configurable.

